    "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trivia Deal is the world\u2019s first trivia roguelike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer fast. Play smart. Use lifelines, swap cards, and relics to survive the Rainbow Reaper. Each run is unforgiving, one wrong answer can end it all. High-stakes strategy with random questions, categories, and rewards that keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/af4e4ef03339f797cc86f23aca95272c.poster.avif?t=1754828731\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/af4e4ef03339f797cc86f23aca95272c.webm?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/af4e4ef03339f797cc86f23aca95272c.mp4?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build Your Trivia Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Choose your path through randomized columns, stack category advantages, and prepare for what's ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/de79182ccb0e1577463a07f61a7b2200.poster.avif?t=1754828731\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/de79182ccb0e1577463a07f61a7b2200.webm?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/de79182ccb0e1577463a07f61a7b2200.mp4?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Purchase Unique Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, spend your hard-earned gold on lifelines, relics, and rare swap cards. Plan your purchases\u2014each decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/ec04a354d4726d8e1395d8d352a8f5f8.poster.avif?t=1754828731\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/ec04a354d4726d8e1395d8d352a8f5f8.webm?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/ec04a354d4726d8e1395d8d352a8f5f8.mp4?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger lifelines like 50/50, Frenzy, and Double Dicey. Chain effects for huge rewards\u2014or burn them trying. Risk and timing are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/59797ca6f679f834c5944578dbf3d38d.poster.avif?t=1754828731\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/59797ca6f679f834c5944578dbf3d38d.webm?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/59797ca6f679f834c5944578dbf3d38d.mp4?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Swap the Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always get stuck with that one topic? Use a Swap Card to trade unwanted trivia for something you actually know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0fb29e5c034a3dc9f58c9684466cf5c6.poster.avif?t=1754828731\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0fb29e5c034a3dc9f58c9684466cf5c6.webm?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0fb29e5c034a3dc9f58c9684466cf5c6.mp4?t=1754828731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defeat the Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Rainbow Reaper in twisted boss rounds that test more than just your trivia knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,000+ multiple choice questions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 trivia categories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 lifeline abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ swap packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
